294 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Applying a single sport as a filter and reducing the number of listed events to 50\054 killed the consumption of data\054 which was mostly related to the match details loaded for thousands of events\054 this without impacting the overall experience as from data we knew that 87\045 of customers are soccer only bettors\056\n\nA  revamped navigation has been required to satisfy the pulsing request from customers to have sports events that can be found easily and at the same time access also other verticals which were hidden or not quickly accessible\056\nAn Omnisearch which works across all sports verticals helped the navigation in the heavy\055duty of making accessible thousands of sports events\056\n\nDevelopment wise\054 the app has been rebased\054 moving from Angular 4 to a lightning\055fast VueJS codebase\056 The app bundle draped from 6\0568Mb to 1\05676Mb\056\nThe makeover involved also some new setup for the server\054 which now applies Gzip and Brotli compression\056\n\050Video\072\050)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 293 0 R
     /Pg 277 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

